<title>USA: Gynecare names Hirsch president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Gynecare names Hirsch president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gynecare Inc said Roseanne Hirsch will join the company as president and chief executive on April 21.</p>
<p>She succeeds A. Lad Burgin, who has been serving as interim president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Hirsch was formerly president and chief executive of Luxar Corp, a maker of laser surgery tools.</p>
